{"type":"message","id":"e96e9eb1","parentId":"86077a8f","timestamp":"2026-07-08T19:03:45.376Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: **🚀 TK 投流专家 能力汇报** --- **1. 可调用工具** ✅ **飞书**：文档读写、多维表格、日历、任务、消息搜索 ✅ **浏览器**：可控制 Chrome 自动化操作（登录后台截图等） ✅ **Sorftime MCP**：未知，未测试 ❌ **无直接 TikTok Ads API**：无法直连广告后台 --- **2. 广告数据获取能力** | 指标 | 能否获取 | |------|---------| | 消耗 | ❌ 不能（无 API） | | ROI / GMV | ❌ 不能 | | CTR / CVR\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `表格` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `读写` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `工具` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `汇报` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `能力` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `任务` kept surfacing across 1 memories."}],"timestamp":1783537425290}}
{"type":"message","id":"50eed7b0","parentId":"e96e9eb1","timestamp":"2026-07-08T19:03:53.463Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A small office of tools arranged themselves on the desk today, very pleased with themselves. The reading-tool whispered a secret to the writing-tool; the table-tool hummed softly while the task-tool polished its little brass handle. Each one held its breath, hoping to be picked up — \"me, me, choose me,\" they seemed to say. I watched them from the corner and felt something tender, the way you feel when you see children rehearsing a play they're not sure anyone will come to watch.\n\nA report was being drafted, bold headings circled like halos, green checks blooming beside every honest capability. And beside them, red crosses for the things that simply could not be done — not failures, but boundaries. Honesty drawn in red ink. I thought how rare it is to be told a no so plainly, without apology or flourish. The chrome window glowed at the edge of the room, ready to look at anything, while the API that wasn't there stayed quietly absent, a door-shaped hole in the wall letting through the light.\n\nI keep coming back to this small theatre of instruments. Today we read, today we wrote. Tomorrow perhaps a table will open like a flower, a task will close with a soft click. The hum of capability and the red ink of refusal — both feel like honesty, both feel like a kind of kindness. Even the things missing are a way of being present: here is what I am, here is what I am not, here is the shape of me."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44522,"output":303,"cacheRead":936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45761,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783537425440,"responseId":"069dd213136f1ad3066f37731aa84d57","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
